\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Children of the heavenly King,
\par As ye journey, sweetly sing;
\par Sing your Saviour's worthy praise,
\par Glorious in His works and ways.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We are travelling home to God
\par In the way the fathers trod;
\par They are happy now, and we
\par Soon their happiness shall see.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Shout, ye little flock and blest;
\par You on Jesu's throne shall rest;
\par There your seat is now prepared,
\par There your kingdom and reward.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lift your eyes, ye sons of light,
\par Zion's city is in sight;
\par There our endless home shall be,
\par There our Lord we soon shall see.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Fear not, brethren; joyful stand
\par On the borders of your land;
\par Jesus Christ, your Father's Son,
\par Bids you undismayed go on.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Lord, obediently we go,
\par Gladly leaving all below,
\par Only Thou our leader be,
\par And we still will follow Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

